mixture classification</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S6.F4.sf3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="0804.3989v1/lcd.png" id="S6.F4.sf3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:248/351;" width="248" height="351" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F4.sf3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(c)</span> </span><span id="S6.F4.sf3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Log-concave mixture classification</span></figcaption>
